  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/846/444/luckyland.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"422\" height=\"68\"></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">這是一個幸運方塊地圖，地圖上有許多建築。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">每個建築內部都有大量的幸運方塊</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">如果出現任何錯誤，請聯繫我們。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/846/445/mapp.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"168\" height=\"68\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/841/274/2024-04-07_11.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1001\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/841/275/2024-04-07_11.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/841/276/new-map.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1001\"></p>",
